abstract: >-
  Research artifacts accompanying the SIAI 2026 paper Corrective Action
  in Medicaid Appeals: Legal Authority and Source Retrieval. Includes
  preserved Nevada retrieval experiments, source-linked Louisiana and
  Colorado audit records, and a post-presentation review of Medicaid
  dental-plan contract amendments and public member handbooks.
